Hello <%= @user.email_address %>!

You have been invited to join BVBhub — the Beach Volleyball Project. To activate your account, choose a password using the link below.

<%= "#{ENV.fetch("FRONTEND_URL", "http://localhost:5174")}/reset-password?token=#{@user.password_reset_token}" %>

This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>. Once you have set your password, you can sign in with your email address and the password you chose.

If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email — nothing will change until you use the link above.